{
  "description": "Path segment and query value encoding (section 6.1), and the ids and arguments refused before any request (sections 4.3, 5.4 and 5.5). Run every case on a server client with the fake transport and compare the URL it receives. Segment cases pass id as the parameter request names, with the other params as given, on customer(id) when the parameter is customer and on customer(params.id) otherwise. The route names the method: GET /customers/{id}/entitlements/{feature} is check(feature), DELETE /customers/{id}?erase=true is erase(), DELETE /customers/{id}/subscription/add-ons/{addOn} is cancel({ addOn }), DELETE /customers/{id}/subscription/add-ons/{addOn}/pending is undoPendingChange({ addOn }), PUT /customers/{id}/add-ons/{addOn} is setAddOn(addOn, { quantity }), POST /customers/{id}/meters/{feature}/adjustments is adjustMeter(feature, { by, idempotencyKey }), POST /customers/{id}/usage/holds/{holdId}/settle is settleUsage(holdId, amount), DELETE /customers/{id}/usage/holds/{holdId} is releaseUsage(holdId), DELETE /customers/{id}/grants/{grantId} is revokeGrant(grantId) and DELETE /customers/{id}/usage/{usageId} is cancelUsage(usageId), each with the other arguments request.options holds. baseUrl cases build the client with baseUrl, null for the default. Query cases set the query parameter to value: GET /customers is customers.list({ q }) or customers.list({ cursor }), reading its first page, DELETE /customers/{id}/subscription is cancel({ product }) and DELETE /customers/{id}/subscription/pending is undoPendingChange({ product }). Arguments cases make call on customer(call.customer) with call.options. outcome is the encoded segment or query value with the final request URL, or the exact argument error, raised before any request. Ids and query values are sent exactly as given, never trimmed. An id or query value that is not valid Unicode is given as UTF-16 code units (idUtf16, valueUtf16), only where strings can hold lone surrogates, and request leaves it out.",
  "spec": "6.1, 4.3, 5.2, 5.3, 5.4, 5.5",
